{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ResumeKit\/documentation\/ResumeKit\/SessionCoordinator"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Discord-style session-resume client. Runs as an actor so callers don’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have to worry about thread-safety; you can poke it from your transport"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"task and from the main actor freely.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionCoordinator","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":1,"anchor":"Architecture","text":"Architecture","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The coordinator owns three pieces of state:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The in-memory "},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (handshaking \/ replaying \/ live \/ disconnected)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A persistent ","type":"text"},{"code":"(sessionId, lastSeq)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" cursor in ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A heartbeat timer that fires while the connection is healthy.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It does ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" own the connection itself — that’s your transport’s"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"problem. The coordinator just decides what to send when you tell it","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“the connection is open” or “I received this frame”."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Lifecycle (the seven calls you’ll m